# Allowlist: runtime state, credentials, backups and build residue never enter context.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**
!deploy/
!deploy/run-trace.sh
!deploy/healthcheck.py
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/**
**/.env*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*secret*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.bak
**/*backup*/**
